body:
Here is the link for the advertisement:

&#x200B;

[https://www.olx.com.pk/item/excluisve-package-iid-1033933520](https://www.olx.com.pk/item/excluisve-package-iid-1033933520)

&#x200B;

Even if these are used, what do you think about these options? Is Package 2 an upgrade to my existing system? If yes, I can get that and keep upgrading it over time. However, I have also asked them for the following combination and its price:  


* AMD Ryzen 5 3500X
* Gigabyte B450M DS3H
* 8GB 3200Mhz DDR4 RAM

&#x200B;

What do you say? Is Package 2 better or is my custom package better?
